  (5, 'Complete Kutch circuit', 'complete-kutch-circuit', 'multi', '2 nights 3 days', 'approx 700 km', 14500.00, 'The full loop covering the Rann, the coast and the craft villages, at a pace that is not rushed.', 'White Rann and Kalo Dungar\nMandvi beach and palace\nBhujodi, Nirona and Ajrakhpur', NULL, 0, 5, 1),
